            <div xml:id="d1613">

                <pb facs="1015" n="899" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg899"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.93/73.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Consul Letcher to the
                            Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Consulate</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Chihuahua</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-04-30">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 30, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Newspaper report that some modification of ordinary restriction against entrance
                    of Japanese and Chinese is now in force. Information is requested, principally
                    in interest of Chinese.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Letcher</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
